Package: ops-monitor
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), coreutils, gawk | awk, sed, grep, curl, tar, gzip, openssl
Maintainer: Ops-Monitor Engineering Team <ops-monitor@example.com>
Description: Lightweight Zero-Dependency Linux Server Monitoring Suite
 Ops-Monitor is a lightweight, zero-external-dependency server monitoring and
 alerting suite built with native POSIX/Bash. It provides procfs-driven metrics
 collection, ANSI/UTF-8 terminal charts, multi-channel webhook alerts, and
 automated lifecycle data archiving with minimal resource overhead.
